    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0027",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "For three decades, six Presidents have come before you to warn of the damage deficits pose to our nation."
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0101",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "That's why we have more than doubled funding for training dislocated workers since 1993."
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0107",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "And remember the big picture here: While we've been entering into hundreds of new trade agreements, we've been creating "
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0134",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "For 13 years, Elaine Kinslow of Indianapolis, Indiana, was on and off welfare."
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0135",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "Today, she's a dispatcher with a van company."
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0195",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "I thank General McCaffrey for his leadership, and I thank this Congress for passing the largest antidrug budget in histo"
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0210",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "For 50 years, NATO contained communism and kept America and Europe secure."
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0211",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "Now these three formerly Communist countries have said yes to democracy."
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0225",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "One of those— —thank you—one of those brave soldiers is sitting with the First Lady tonight: Army Sergeant Michael Tolbe"
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0227",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "After college in Colorado, he joined the Army."
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0236",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "I'm pleased to announce that four former Chairmen of the Joint Chiefs of Staff—Generals John Shalikashvili, Colin Powell"
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0243",
      "old": "TRUE",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "I know I speak for everyone in this chamber, Republicans and Democrats, when I say to Saddam Hussein, \"You cannot defy t"
    },
    {
      "sid": "clinton_1998:0358",
      "old": "MISLEADING",
      "new": "gated-UNVERIFIABLE",
      "category": "newly_gated",
      "text": "Beginning this year, 1998, men and women from 16 countries will build a foothold in the heavens, the international space"
    }
  ]
}
